From 8096359ade62f28adead52078285125f1991f81c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TickTrade Workbench <workbench@local>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 14:52:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(admin): break the login/admin redirect loop for
 non-admin or incomplete sessions

ProtectedRoute now reads user/token from the auth store (not the base64 localStorage blob), sends non-admin and half-restored sessions to /unauthorized instead of bouncing to /, and the recovery page signs out before returning to login. Adds tests/admin-auth-routing.test.cjs (12 cases). Ported from the local tool's validated but never-applied proposal admin-auth-loop-2026-09-12 (baseline 4/12 -> 12/12).
